---
import ImmersiveIntro from './ImmersiveIntro.astro';
import CompanyHome from './CompanyHome.astro';
import Header from './Header.astro';

---
  <Header overIntro />
  <main id="main-content">
    <ImmersiveIntro />
    <div class="corporate-content" id="company-overview" tabindex="-1">
      <section class="company-introduction section site-shell" id="company-introduction" aria-labelledby="company-intro-title">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">WE ARE UTSUSHIMI</p><p class="company-name">うつしみ株式会社</p></div>
        <div>
          <h2 id="company-intro-title">ちがう身体も、<br /><span>自分の身体のように。</span></h2>
          <div class="company-lead">
            <p>「うつしみ」は、自分を別の姿へと写す「写し身」。</p>
            <p>指先に込めた力や、その人が使える動きを、ロボットやアバタの動きにつなぐ。人とはかたちも機能も違う身体を、自分の身体のように自在に使いこなせる体験をつくります。</p>
            <p>自分の手でできることを、身体のかたちにとらわれず広げていく。<br class="desktop-break" />それが、うつしみの目指す未来です。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="company-intro-links"><a class="text-link" href="/company/">私たちについて <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/products/">身体性インタフェースの技術 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <CompanyHome showHero={false} />
    </div>
  </main>
<style>
  .corporate-content { position: relative; z-index: 5; background: var(--color-surface); scroll-margin-top: 92px; }
  :global(.cinema-intro[data-motion]) ~ .corporate-content { margin-top: -20svh; }
  .company-introduction { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr; gap: 44px; padding-block: 100px 96px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); scroll-margin-top: 0; }
  .company-introduction .eyebrow { padding-top: 12px; }
  .company-name { margin-top: 18px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 13px; }
  .company-introduction h2 { font-size: var(--size-heading, clamp(34px, 3.6vw, 50px)); letter-spacing: -.045em; line-height: var(--line-heading, 1.6); }
  .company-introduction h2 > span { color: var(--color-brand); }
  .company-lead { font-size: var(--size-lead, 17px); line-height: var(--line-lead, 2.1); color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-top: 32px; }
  .company-lead p + p { margin-top: 18px; }
  .company-intro-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px 42px; margin-top: 30px; }
  @media(max-width:950px) { .corporate-content { scroll-margin-top: 76px; } }
  @media(max-width:760px) {
    .company-introduction { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; padding-block: 56px 64px; }
    .company-introduction .eyebrow { padding-top: 0; }
    .company-name { margin-top: 10px; }
    .company-introduction h2 { font-size: var(--size-heading, clamp(27px, 7.3vw, 36px)); }
    .company-lead { font-size: var(--size-lead, 16px); margin-top: 24px; }
    .desktop-break { display: none; }
    .company-intro-links { gap: 20px 32px; margin-top: 24px; }
  }
</style>
